### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat — synchronous (creates/continues thread "default")
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are the top 5 most rented films?",
  "thread_id": "default"
}

###

### Chat — synchronous, named session
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show me action films",
  "thread_id": "alice"
}

###

### Chat — follow-up in the same session (context is preserved)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Which of those are available to rent right now?",
  "thread_id": "alice"
}

###

### Chat — semantic/vibe search
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I want something with a road trip and comedy vibes",
  "thread_id": "alice"
}

###

### Chat — streaming (SSE)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "Tell me about films starring Penelope Cruz",
  "thread_id": "streaming-test"
}

###

### Sessions — list all active sessions
GET http://localhost:8000/sessions
Accept: application/json

###

### Sessions — get history for a session
GET http://localhost:8000/sessions/alice
Accept: application/json

###

### Sessions — delete a session
DELETE http://localhost:8000/sessions/alice
Accept: application/json

###
